  "content": "[Intro]\n[F]\n[Am]\n[G]\n[F]\n[Am]\n[G]Today\n\n[Verse 1]\n[F]\n[Am]\n[G]You were far away\n[F]\n[Am]\n[G]And I\n[F]\n[Am]\n[G]Didn't ask you \"Why?\"\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n[C]\n[Em]\nWhat could I\n[F]say?\n[G]\nI was far a-\n[F]way\n[Am]\n[G]You just walked a-\n[F]way\n[Am]\nAnd I\n[G]just watched you\n[F]\n[Am]\n[G]What could I\n\n[Chorus]\n[C]say?\n[Em]\nHow close am\n[F]I\n[G]To lo-\nsing you?\n\n[Bridge]\n[F]\n[Am]\n[G]Tonight\n\n[Verse 2]\n[F]\n[Am]\n[G]You just close your\n[F]eyes\n[Am]\nAnd I\n[G]just watch you\n[F]\n[Am]\n[G]Slip away\n\n[Chorus]\n[C]\n[Em]\nHow close am\n[F]I\n[G]To lo-\nsing you?\n\n[Bridge]\n[F]\n[Am]\n[G]\n[F]\n[Am]\n[G]\n\n[Verse 3]\n[F]Hey\n[Am]Are you awake?\nYeah, I'm right here\n[G]Well, can I ask\n[F]you\n[Am]\n[G]About today?\n\n[Chorus]\n[C]\n[Em]\nHow close am\n[F]I\n[G]To lo-\nsing you?\n[C]\n[Em]\nHow close am\n[F]I\n[G]To lo-\nsing\n\n[Outro]",
